Provenance note: farfield implements audio-guidance techniques described
in Robert Monroe's expired patents (US 3,884,218; US 5,213,562;
US 5,356,368) and the spatial-angle-modulation technique disclosed in The
Monroe Institute's abandoned patent applications (US 2013/0010967 A1;
US 2015/0016613 A1). Expired and abandoned patent documents are published
prior art, free for anyone to practice. Presets marked "measured-tape" or
"measured-mss" encode frequencies, beat rates, and timings measured by
spectral analysis of personal copies of commercial recordings; such
measurements are unprotectable facts. No audio, narration, or music from
any recording is included in or reproduced by this project.

